<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The order in which you fought the Bosses will shape the Final Boss that you must defeat to win the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning will unlock one higher difficulty level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless:</strong><br>Choose between 3 randomly generated Regions with randomized features. Once cleared, you get 3 new choices, and so on infinitely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty increases sharply after each Region and it doesn't end until you lose. See how far you can make it!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the perfect Squad by freely selecting any Heroes, Minions, Items and Relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your Squad against a wide variety of pre-defined challenges</p></li></ul>",
